"Полоса 8: 4000 Гц\n"
"Полоса 9: 8000 Гц\n"
"Полоса 10: 16000 Гц\n"
"См. также [AudioEffectEQ], [AudioEffectEQ6], [AudioEffectEQ21]."

msgid ""
"Frequency bands:\n"
"Band 1: 22 Hz\n"
"Band 2: 32 Hz\n"
"Band 3: 44 Hz\n"
"Band 4: 63 Hz\n"
"Band 5: 90 Hz\n"
